    <string-array name="door_control_descriptions">
        <item>Locks or unlocks the selected door area and confirms the resulting vehicle state.</item><item>Prevents the selected rear door from being opened using its interior handle.</item><item>Shows and sets the supported opening position of a powered door.</item><item>Requests powered closing, stop, or opening for the selected door.</item>
        <item>Enables the supported passenger-window lock for the selected area.</item><item>Shows and sets the supported opening position of the selected window.</item><item>Requests closing, stop, or opening for the selected window.</item><item>Locks or unlocks powered mirror adjustment when supported.</item>
        <item>Folds or unfolds the selected exterior mirror.</item><item>Allows exterior mirrors to fold automatically with the vehicle lock policy.</item><item>Allows the selected mirror to tilt while reversing when supported.</item><item>Adjusts the selected mirror upward or downward.</item><item>Adjusts the selected mirror left or right.</item>
    </string-array>
